{
  "_comment": [
    "Which physical board each short label means, by CPU UID.",
    "",
    "Copy this file to boards.json (gitignored -- UIDs are per-machine) and put",
    "your own boards' UIDs in. A board's UID is printed in boot_out.txt on its",
    "own drive, and is also its USB serial number:",
    "",
    "    .\.venv\Scripts\python.exe .\tools\boards.py",
    "",
    "lists every attached board with its UID, drive and COM port, so the usual",
    "way to fill this in is to run that with one board plugged in at a time.",
    "",
    "Only maintainers running two boards at once need this. A student has one",
    "board and every tool finds it without a label."
  ],

  "A": "put-a-uid-here",
  "B": "put-the-other-uid-here"
}
